{"id":"n44204-1-11","stage":5,"title":"담장 · 墙","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44204-1-11-1","ko":"열쇠가 없다고 했잖아. 그런데 어떻게 집으로 들어온 거야?","zh":"你不是说没有钥匙吗？那你怎么进到家里来的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"열쇠가","meaning":"钥匙","explanation":"열쇠：钥匙；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열쇠","audio":"/audio/5bebbcbf30ba30c05971.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26888","senseId":"1","lemma":"열쇠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열쇠가","audio":"/audio/f90f53270af84cff6d27.mp3"}},{"text":"없다고","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없다고","audio":"/audio/37a66ee225598f42588a.mp3"}},{"text":"했잖아.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했잖아","audio":"/audio/946efc19d51cb603a2b1.mp3"}},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"그런데：可是，可","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"집으로","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집으로","audio":"/audio/8a97350e9fb8cc1c83d4.mp3"}},{"text":"들어온","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어온","audio":"/audio/5d5dd728f70348d8a023.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5bebbcbf30ba30c0","term":"열쇠","zh":"钥匙","audio":"/audio/5bebbcbf30ba30c05971.mp3","entryId":"26888","definition":"可以锁上或打开门锁的工具。","pronunciation":["열ː쐬","열ː쒜"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"可是，可","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"用于将话题与前面内容相连接的同时，又将话头转向其他方向。","pronunciation":["그런데"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/77e24a6cce6721d4bb74.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44204-1-11-2","ko":"응, 담장을 타고 넘어서 들어왔어.","zh":"嗯，我是翻过围墙进来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"담장을","meaning":"墙，围墙","explanation":"담장：墙，围墙；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"담장","audio":"/audio/146f39e8841cdbe8b3f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44204","senseId":"1","lemma":"담장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담장을","audio":"/audio/e1863207ce1b3c25b685.mp3"}},{"text":"타고","meaning":"爬，攀，登","explanation":"타다：爬，攀，登；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"3","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타고","audio":"/audio/8aebcd33801f792f7638.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어서","meaning":"翻越，跨越","explanation":"넘다：翻越，跨越；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"3","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어서","audio":"/audio/51fdf77d9a43928bc721.mp3"}},{"text":"들어왔어.","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어왔어","audio":"/audio/d4e2adc85491191e05e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"146f39e8841cdbe8","term":"담장","zh":"墙，围墙","audio":"/audio/146f39e8841cdbe8b3f6.mp3","entryId":"44204","definition":"为了围起房子周围或一定的空间而用土、石头和砖等垒起来的物体。","pronunciation":["담장"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"爬，攀，登","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"攀爬或下滑斜坡、树木、山崖等。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"翻越，跨越","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"跨过分界。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/52002a84dd9a80f35415.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.137,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=44204","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.6137,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，我是翻过围墙进来的。","你不是说没有钥匙吗？那你怎么进到家里来的？","大学录取结果要一个小时后才公布吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你不是说没有钥匙吗？那你怎么进到家里来的？","大学录取结果要一个小时后才公布吗？","嗯，我是翻过围墙进来的。"],"answer":2}]}
